{"step_index":1781,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T13:08:40Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Documented the implementation of Lead Priority Tiers (Fresh vs Legacy) and Named Campaign Lists with auto-deployment to Surge.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: ValuTeachers Priority Tier & Named Campaign Lists Implementation\\n\\n## 1. Overview\\nWe implemented **Priority Tier Weighting (Strategy 1)** seamlessly unified with **Named Campaign Lists (Strategy 2)** for ValuTeachers.\\n\\nThis gives you total control when snapping in older/legacy lead cards:\\n- **Priority Tiering:** Fresh cards (`Tier 1`) are called before any Legacy cards (`Tier 3`) in the master queue.\\n- **Campaign Isolation:** You can group legacy cards into dedicated lists (e.g. *\\\"2023-2024 Legacy Vault\\\"*) or keep them in the Master Pipeline.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Key Features Implemented\\n\\n### A. Scanning & Ingestion Screen (`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`)\\n- **1-Tap Priority Toggle:** Choose between:\\n  - 🟢 **Fresh / Hot Lead (Tier 1 - Default)** — Prioritized at the very top of calling queues.\\n  - 🏛️ **Legacy / Archive (Tier 3)** — Positioned at the very end of calling queues.\\n- **Campaign List Assignment:**\\n  - Select existing lists (e.g. *Master Pipeline*, *2023-2024 Legacy Vault*).\\n  - Create new lists on the fly using **+ New List**.\\n\\n### B. Calling Queue Ordering Engine (`leadsRepository.ts` & `database.ts`)\\n- Both SQLite and Web LocalStorage query engines now use:\\n  ```sql\\n  ORDER BY priority_tier ASC, attempts_count ASC, created_at ASC\\n  ```\\n- **Guaranteed Queue Behavior:**\\n  1. Fresh leads (`Tier 1`) with 0 attempts are dialed first.\\n  2. Follow-up calls for fresh leads (`Tier 1`, attempts ≥ 1) occur next.\\n  3. Legacy leads (`Tier 3`) are dialed only after active fresh leads are worked through.\\n\\n### C. Main Dashboard & Pipeline View (`ListsScreen.tsx`)\\n- **Campaign List Filter Bar:** Quick filter chips for *All Campaigns*, custom lists, *Fresh Only*, and *Legacy Only*.\\n- **Visual Priority Badges:** Leads display `🔥 Fresh` or `🏛️ Legacy` badges alongside disposition statuses.\\n\\n### D. Lead Detail & Power Dialer HUD (`LeadDetailScreen.tsx` & `DialerHudScreen.tsx`)\\n- **1-Tap Priority Switcher:** Tap the priority pill on any lead's profile to toggle betwe\n<truncated 387 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with Priority Tier and Campaign List details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
